'''Gork''' was a [[Gamorrean]] [[Gender|male]]<ref name="Gork Gender & Other" /> [[pirate]] who served as a member of [[Kragan Gorr]]'s [[Warbird gang|pirate gang]] during the [[First Order-Resistance War]].<ref name="No Escape" /> He was noted to be a gifted arm&ndash;wrestler, though his matches typically ended in brawls.<ref name="SWE" />
{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Gork first appeared in the [[2019]] episode "[[No Escape: Part 2]]" of the animated series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]''. He is voiced by [[Jonathan Lipow]].<ref name="No Escape" /> He was first identified as Gork in the credits of "[[A Quick Salvage Run]]."<ref name="AQSR">{{Resistance|A Quick Salvage Run}}</ref>

An earlier version of the episode "[[The Engineer]]" had [[Kazuda Xiono]] running into Gork while investigating the pirate power siphoning, leading [[Synara San]] to come to Xiono's rescue by punching Gork out cold.<ref name="Gork Gender & Other" />

